  "rank": {
   "description": "A player or poll rank. A number when the source ranks the player; the string \"NR\" when the source lists the player as unranked (renders NR); null when there is no source or value (renders UNKNOWN). gen.py also accepts \"unranked\", \"not ranked\" and \"N/R\" and turns them into \"NR\". Never write NA.",
